  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Bandakisa ya code, ba-schema ya JSON, mpe ba-modèle ya politiki oyo masini ekoki kotánga ezali na se ya Lisansi MIT, longola kaka soki elobami ndenge mosusu. Okoki kotia yango na ba-site na yo moko na bonsomi.",
