  "Commercial use requires contact": "Kosalela na mombongo esengaka kontakte",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Esengami nsima ya Bletchley AI Safety Summit mpe ekambami na Yoshua Bengio elongo na baye baleki 100 oyo bapesaki mayele, kobanda na mikili pene na 30 elongo na UN, OECD mpe EU, lapolo oyo ya bonsomi esangisi biyano ya siansi ya sikoyo na tina ya makoki mpe likama ya AI ya liboso — elobi ete ba-système mosusu ekoki sikoyo koyeba tango bazali kotalela yango mpe kobongola ezaleli na yango.",
  "Companion media": "Media oyo elandi",
