  "Empirical Research": "Bolukiluki ya Bomeki",
  "English edition →": "Édition na Lingelesi →",
  "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Kokokisa ete bopolele ekoki kosalema na masini — mpo ete bolingo malamu ebwakama te lokola ntembe ya mibeko.",
